DESCRIPTION >
    - `collection_contributors_geo_distribution_over_time.pipe` serves the over-time chart of the CNCF report: for each period, the organizations active in the CNCF collection, by country.
    - Reads `cncf_organization_countries_monthly_ds`, rebuilt daily by `cncf_organization_countries_monthly_copy.pipe`; see that pipe for how organizations are placed in countries.
    - An organization active in several months of a year counts once for that year. Periods with no placed organization are left out.
    - Parameters:
    - `granularity`: Required string for time period intervals ('monthly', 'yearly')
    - `startDate`: Optional DateTime; the first period is the one containing it (e.g., '2024-01-01 00:00:00'). Defaults to the first month with activity
    - `endDate`: Optional DateTime; only periods starting before it are returned (e.g., '2024-12-31 00:00:00'). Defaults to now
    - Response: `startDate`, `endDate`, `country`, `flag`, `country_code`, `contributorCount` (the number of organizations)

TOKEN "insights-app-token" READ

TAGS "Report"

NODE collection_contributors_geo_distribution_over_time_result
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        if(
            {{ String(granularity, description="Time granularity: monthly or yearly", required=True) }}
            = 'yearly',
            toStartOfYear(month),
            month
        ) AS "startDate",
        if(
            {{ granularity }} = 'yearly',
            toDate("startDate" + INTERVAL 1 YEAR - INTERVAL 1 DAY),
            toDate("startDate" + INTERVAL 1 MONTH - INTERVAL 1 DAY)
        ) AS "endDate",
        country,
        flag,
        country_code,
        uniqExact(organizationId) AS "contributorCount"
    FROM cncf_organization_countries_monthly_ds
    WHERE
        "startDate"
        < {% if defined(endDate) %}
            toDate(
                {{
                    DateTime(
                        endDate,
                        description="Only periods starting before this date are returned",
                        required=False,
                    )
                }}
            )
        {% else %} today()
        {% end %}
        {% if defined(startDate) %}
            AND "startDate" >= if(
                {{ granularity }} = 'yearly',
                toStartOfYear(
                    toDate(
                        {{
                            DateTime(
                                startDate,
                                description="The first period is the one containing this date",
                                required=False,
                            )
                        }}
                    )
                ),
                toStartOfMonth(toDate({{ DateTime(startDate, required=False) }}))
            )
        {% end %}
    GROUP BY "startDate", "endDate", country, flag, country_code
    ORDER BY "startDate" ASC, "contributorCount" DESC
